<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "1">
<ptxt>
<emph>
B1090-15: Driver Forward Impact Sensor Circuit Open
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Forward impact sensor circuit has been shorted to power supply or opened.
</ptxt>
</entry>
